      <p class="pk-elixir-banner__copy">Elixir is the Clash Royale platform POAP KINGS built, and all three of <a href="/clans/">our clans</a> run on it. It records the history the game forgets — battles, rosters, river races — and answers from it: in our Discord, in your inbox, and to your own AI agent.</p>
      <div class="pk-drop-actions">
        {{ actionLink('https://elixir.poapkings.com/', 'Visit Elixir ↗', 'gold', 'elixir.visit', true) }}
        {{ actionLink('https://elixir.poapkings.com/console/signin?request', 'Request access', 'outline', 'elixir.request', true) }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pk-section">
    {{ sectionHeading('In our clans', 'What Elixir does for members') }}
    <div class="pk-grid-3 pk-elixir-jobs">
      {%- set elixirJobs = [
        { num: '01', title: 'An agent in Discord', body: 'Each clan in the network has its own Elixir agent in our Discord. Ask it about your battles, your decks or the war; every fact it gives is read from Elixir moments before it says it.' },
        { num: '02', title: 'Posts what happened', body: 'The same agent posts the clan\'s news as it happens, straight from Elixir\'s record of the clan rather than anyone\'s memory.' },
        { num: '03', title: 'Remembers every battle', body: 'The game shows your last few dozen battles. Elixir keeps every one it records, with river races and roster history, so there is a record to answer from.' },
        { num: '04', title: 'A weekly email', body: 'With an Elixir account you get a Monday report on your clan\'s week and a Tuesday recap of your own battles. Every kind of email is a switch you control.' },
        { num: '05', title: 'Elixir Clan for leaders', body: 'Standing, the Elder band and the actions waiting for a leader, judged by each clan\'s own written policy, never by a default.' },
        { num: '06', title: 'Elixir Drop', body: 'Our free card-cost trainer. Its seasons follow the Clan Wars clock, which it reads from Elixir.' }
      ] -%}
      {%- for j in elixirJobs %}
      {{ numberedCard(j.num, j.title, j.body) }}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pk-section">
    {{ sectionHeading('For any clan', 'Built by POAP KINGS, open to everyone', actionLink('https://github.com/jthingelstad/elixir-mcp', 'View the code on GitHub →', 'outline', 'elixir.github', true)) }}
    <p class="pk-elixir-tech-copy">Elixir started as POAP KINGS' own clan bot. It is now a platform <strong>any clan or player can use</strong>, and its own site is the place to learn about it: what it records, how to connect an agent, and the record it has built so far. Access is granted by hand while the record grows. Elixir is free, sponsor-supported, and <strong>built in the open</strong>.</p>
    <div class="pk-tech3">
      {%- set elixirLinks = [
        { label: 'The platform', value: 'elixir.poapkings.com', href: 'https://elixir.poapkings.com/', key: 'home' },
